{"id":351,"date":"2017-05-27T11:25:37","date_gmt":"2017-05-27T11:25:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/?page_id=351"},"modified":"2021-05-04T16:18:13","modified_gmt":"2021-05-04T15:18:13","slug":"excel-web-integration-ecommerce","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/excel-web-integration-ecommerce\/","title":{"rendered":"Excel Web &#038; eCommerce Integration"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"678\" src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/lukas-blazek-mcSDtbWXUZU-unsplash-1024x678.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-25508\" title=\"Excel Web Integration &amp; Ecommerce\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/lukas-blazek-mcSDtbWXUZU-unsplash-1024x678.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/lukas-blazek-mcSDtbWXUZU-unsplash-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/lukas-blazek-mcSDtbWXUZU-unsplash-768x509.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/lukas-blazek-mcSDtbWXUZU-unsplash-1536x1018.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/lukas-blazek-mcSDtbWXUZU-unsplash.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"title-heading-center wp-block-heading\">Excel\u2019s connectivity enables a swift and easy transfer of data between the office and the web.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"font-inherit wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>More often than not, Excel offers a level of automation not offered by other software. If you know excel, this is what you expect. But what few know is that excel can shortcut both the front end and back end of every CMS on the market. These (Content Management Systems) include WordPress, Drupal, Magento etc.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This enables us to build Excel-based Web CMS\u2019s. These are 100% bespoke to the client\u2019s requirements. Using Excel offline opens up the option to dynamically generate a static web site and minimises dynamic content, dramatically improving page loading times. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Additionally, pages will display in less than a second, which leads to a whole new experience for those browsing the site. If a page hardly ever changes, why calculate it every time for every visitor? The bonus is that for SEO purposes, every page becomes a landing page.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Excel Web functions can also be used to connect directly to other servers. This is covered by our section on <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/api-connection\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">API Connections<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">VBA offers direct automation control over Internet Content<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With Excel we can build a diverse range of Excel Web applications, offering a variety of related services. Initially starting by striping data from web pages, this can progress to complex applications.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"font-inherit wp-block-heading\">Excel Web Related Projects in Development<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To be made available as downloads.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Google Analytics &amp; Search Engine Console APIs Front End \u2013 For fully automated analytics monitoring and reporting.<\/li><li>PHP Admin Front End \u2013 This enables Excel to manage your online databases directly. &nbsp;This replaces manual operation.<\/li><li>Website Checker \u2013 page load times, link listing and checking. Also check for malware files and code insertion<\/li><li>Tag Manager \u2013 Lists all the occurrences of any tag on a single web page or the whole site with numerous different uses.<\/li><li>Rankchecker \u2013 Check where your keywords rank on Google, Bing and Yahoo. No need to export the data into Excel as it is already there!<\/li><li>FTP Front End \u2013 Excel can automatically upload or download files as required without any&nbsp;manual FTP operation.<\/li><li>Excel based CMS \u2013 The ultimate goal for the generation and management of websites.<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"font-inherit wp-block-heading\">Additional eCommerce Considerations<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In addition to getting the back and front end of your website communicating quickly and efficiently using Excel, we also recommend researching the latest requirements and best practices from a legal and SEO standpoint.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">GDPR<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A new European regulation enters into force on July 16th 2021. The new<br>Regulation will require all businesses to have a legal point of contact<br>within the EU, of whom the address is printed on the product or packaging.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This will have a huge impact on all non-EU businesses, selling products on<br>the EU market. Read more about appointing an <a href=\"https:\/\/instrktiv.com\/en\/authorised-representative\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">authorised representative<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Digital Marketing <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Investing in digital marketing is essential if you want to start generating more orders and expanding your operations. Some of the core activities you need to think about are SEO, digital advertising and great product information and images. This article has some great tips to help you <a href=\"https:\/\/barnesandshirley.co\/building-successful-ecommerce\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">grow eCommerce revenue<\/a>.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Excel\u2019s connectivity enables a swift and easy transfer of data between the office and the web. More often than not, Excel offers a level of automation not offered by other software. If you know excel, this is what you expect. But what few know is that excel can shortcut both the front end and back<a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/excel-web-integration-ecommerce\/\" title=\"ReadExcel Web &#038; eCommerce Integration\">&#8230; Read more &raquo;<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featur